OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 sailor and SBS member dies
OL,4,Aaged 101
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis wife Gwen Francis said his family
OL,7,Fwas "heartbroken" and "grateful for all
OL,8,Fthe kindness people have shown" them.
